  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "1729-root",
    "title": "Inauguration of the Aga Khan Garden, Alberta",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "University of Alberta and AKU have been working in partnership for decades.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "6932cd797c385e57",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "1729-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/1729-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": "Aga Khan Garden is a symbol of the continued intellectual, educational and cultural collaboration between the University of Alberta and the Aga Khan Development Network. Photo: AKDN",
        "alt": "Inauguration of the Aga Khan Garden, Alberta"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Lieutenant Governor of Alberta Lois Mitchell, Alberta Premier Rachel Notley and His Highness the Aga Khan inaugurated the new Aga Khan Garden, Alberta, the northern-most Islamic garden in the world, and the first garden of its kind in western Canada."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Chancellor's gift of spectacular Aga Khan Garden is a symbol of the continued intellectual, educational and cultural collaboration between the University of Alberta and the Aga Khan Development Network."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The University of Alberta and Aga Khan University have been working together for decades. In 2017, the universities "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "renewed a memorandum of understanding",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "/news/aga-khan-gift-creates-spectacular-new-garden-for-research-and-learning",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "story",
                    "uuid": "7eb0b131-d8ab-5978-93d4-86694e48ed2f",
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", originally signed in 2006, to move forward their respective goals of increasing global engagement and promoting equitable human development for citizens around the world."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Learn more on "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AKDN",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.akdn.org/press-release/aga-khan-garden-inaugurated-canada",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "UoA",
              "marks": [
                {
